  "prefLabel": "En 1012.03 Group Window",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1012.03 Group Window. The utility shall identify all facilities eligible for inclusion in the group within 40 business days of the initial group study notification. The utility may include additional facilities in the group after closing the group window with approval from the applicant and other applicants eligible for the group study.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
